# ---- Models & large weights (downloaded / retrained, never committed) ----
# NOTE: server/models/ is ALSO a Python source package (vigil_cfc.py, forecast_lstm.py,
# user.py, message.py). Ignore downloaded weight subdirs, but KEEP the .py source.
# (git does not support inline trailing comments in .gitignore — keep them on own lines)
/models/
# downloaded HF/weight subdirectories under server/models/
server/models/*/
# but keep the neural-net + schema source files
!server/models/*.py
!server/models/__init__.py
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.pt
*.onnx
*.bin

# Vendored external repo (has its own git history; keep out of ours)
server/scripts/mlx-examples/
server/scripts/.cache/

